/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/float.k-122-
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/float.k-123-  // ---- the remaining comparisons (gtF promoted from find_zero — its summaries
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/float.k-124-  //      case-split on the atom; >= / <= derive from the two opaque compares) ----
