codex
The semantic audit found a fatal issue that the mechanical gates cannot see: generated `SortScope` has no constructors, while the frozen K semantics defines `Scope` by `scope(Map, Parent)`. Therefore the only generated conjunct is vacuous—Lean proves it for completely bogus constant implementations by eliminating the impossible `_V : SortScope`. Separately, the candidate’s `_Map_` is list append and fails K’s declared commutativity even on two disjoint singleton maps. Both counterexamples elaborate successfully.
